Package: PhysioRecipes
Title: Reproducible Analysis Case Studies for the PhysioExperiment Ecosystem
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3977-4313"))
Description: A version-controlled database of self-contained, reproducible
    analysis case studies on public physiological data, built on the
    PhysioExperiment ecosystem. Each case states a proposition, answers a
    question on a public dataset and completes through to figures and a
    conclusion, with every reported number traced to an artifact and the whole
    op-DAG replayable byte-identically. The package ships the verified run
    bundles and a small API to browse the case metadata, open a case's bundle,
    and check the invariants that every case must satisfy.
